```

Then list it in that profile's `package.json` under `dsh.profile.bundles`:

```json
{
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-base",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-web-app",
        "dsh-mobile-topbar"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Restart the profile (e.g. `dsh web`) to pick it up.
